  "source": "tools/file_map_scanner_80_threshold/index.html",
  "viewHTML": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head> <meta charset=\"utf-8\" /> <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" /> <title>Fantasy Map Border + Terrain Scanner</title> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body> <header class=\"topbar\"> <div> <h1>Fantasy Map Border + Terrain Scanner</h1> <p>Upload a fantasy map, import or draw borders, classify terrain, calculate areas, and export JSON/CSV/GeoJSON.</p> </div> <div class=\"pill\">HTML + CSS + JavaScript · Offline</div> </header> <main class=\"shell\"> <aside class=\"panel controls\"> <section> <h2>1. Load map</h2> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Map image <input id=\"mapFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\" /> </label> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Border JSON / GeoJSON / exported scan JSON <input id=\"borderFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"application/json,.json,.geojson\" /> </label> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"sampleBtn\" type=\"button\">Create sample map</button> <button id=\"clearBtn\" type=\"button\">Clear</button> </div> </section> <section class=\"fileMatcherSection\"> <h2>File + Map Folder Scanner</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Upload/select files and folder paths, then match images by visual terrain/color clues plus file names. HTML, JSON, CSS, and JS are scanned by file name and text content.</p> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Files to scan: images, HTML, JSON, CSS, JS <input id=\"scanFiles\" type=\"file\" multiple accept=\"image/*,.html,.htm,.json,.css,.js,application/json,text/html,text/css,text/javascript,application/javascript\" /> </label> <label class=\"fileLabel\">Optional directory picker: extracts folder names + scans supported files <input id=\"scanDirectory\" type=\"file\" webkitdirectory directory multiple /> </label> <label>Folder names / paths to match against <textarea id=\"folderNames\" rows=\"7\" placeholder=\"maps/Coastal River/Beach and grass with water&#10;maps/Lush Forest/Deep forest&#10;templates/Plains/Farming\"></textarea> </label> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"loadthe source worldFoldersBtn\" type=\"button\">Load the source world folders</button> <button id=\"clearMatcherBtn\" type=\"button\">Clear matcher</button> </div> <label>Auto-sort threshold: <span id=\"matchThresholdValue\">80%</span> <input id=\"matchThreshold\" type=\"range\" min=\"50\" max=\"100\" value=\"80\" /> </label> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"scanFileMatchesBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Scan file matches</button> <button id=\"exportMatchManifestBtn\" type=\"button\">Export match manifest</button> </div> </section> <section> <h2>2. Borders</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Import polygons, or draw one by clicking around the border. Double-click or press “Close border”.</p> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"drawBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Draw border</button> <button id=\"closeBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Close border</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"deleteBorderBtn\" type=\"button\">Delete selected</button> <button id=\"fitBtn\" type=\"button\">Fit map</button> </div> <label>Selected border/province <select id=\"borderSelect\"></select> </label> <label>New border name <input id=\"borderName\" type=\"text\" value=\"Province 1\" /> </label> </section> <section> <h2>3. Coordinates + area scale</h2> <p class=\"hint\">Use longitude/latitude bounds for geographic area, or use a known total map/border area.</p> <div class=\"grid4\"> <label>West lon <input id=\"lonMin\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"-180\" /></label> <label>East lon <input id=\"lonMax\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"180\" /></label> <label>South lat <input id=\"latMin\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"-90\" /></label> <label>North lat <input id=\"latMax\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"90\" /></label> </div> <label>Known area for selected border or whole map (sq mi) <input id=\"knownSqMi\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.0001\" placeholder=\"optional\" /> </label> <label>Known area applies to <select id=\"knownAreaMode\"> <option value=\"selected\">selected border</option> <option value=\"map\">entire image</option> </select> </label> </section> <section> <h2>4. Classifier</h2> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"autoPaletteBtn\" type=\"button\">Auto-pick map colors</button> <button id=\"scanBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"primary\">Scan borders</button> </div> <label>Classification mode <select id=\"modeSelect\"> <option value=\"hybrid\">hybrid: trained colors + fantasy heuristics</option> <option value=\"palette\">trained / auto colors only</option> <option value=\"heuristic\">fantasy color heuristics only</option> </select> </label> <label>Minimum patch size in pixels <input id=\"minPatch\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" value=\"60\" /> </label> <label>Color tolerance <input id=\"tolerance\" type=\"range\" min=\"5\" max=\"120\" value=\"44\" /> </label> <div id=\"legendEditor\" class=\"legendEditor\"></div> <button id=\"addClassBtn\" type=\"button\">Add custom class</button> <p class=\"hint\">Tip: click a class swatch, then click the map to train that class from the exact map color.</p> </section> <section> <h2>5. Export</h2> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"exportJsonBtn\" type=\"button\">Export JSON</button> <button id=\"exportCsvBtn\" type=\"button\">Export CSV</button> </div> <div class=\"row two\"> <button id=\"exportGeoBtn\" type=\"button\">Export GeoJSON</button> <button id=\"savePngBtn\" type=\"button\">Save overlay PNG</button> </div> </section> </aside> <section class=\"workspace\"> <div class=\"toolbar\"> <button id=\"zoomOutBtn\" type=\"button\">−</button> <input id=\"zoomSlider\" type=\"range\" min=\"25\" max=\"600\" value=\"100\" /> <button id=\"zoomInBtn\" type=\"button\">+</button> <button id=\"panModeBtn\" type=\"button\">Pan</button> <button id=\"inspectBtn\" type=\"button\">Inspect</button> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showMask\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> overlay</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showBorders\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> borders</label> <label class=\"check\"><input id=\"showLabels\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> labels</label> </div> <div id=\"canvasWrap\" class=\"canvasWrap\"> <canvas id=\"mapCanvas\"></canvas> <canvas id=\"overlayCanvas\"></canvas> </div> </section> <aside class=\"panel results\"> <section> <h2>Scan summary</h2> <div id=\"status\" class=\"status\">Load a map to begin.</div> <div id=\"totals\" class=\"totals\"></div> </section> <section> <h2>Detected areas</h2> <div id=\"tableWrap\" class=\"tableWrap\"></div> </section> <section> <h2>File/folder match results</h2> <div id=\"fileMatchSummary\" class=\"status\">No file scan yet.</div> <div id=\"fileMatchTableWrap\" class=\"tableWrap\"></div> </section> <section> <h2>Inspector</h2> <pre id=\"inspector\">Click Inspect, then click the map.</pre> </section> </aside> </main> <template id=\"classTemplate\"> <div class=\"classRow\"> <button class=\"swatch\" type=\"button\" title=\"Click, then click the map to sample\"></button> <input class=\"className\" type=\"text\" /> <select class=\"classType\"> <option>water</option><option>river</option><option>lake</option><option>coast</option><option>reef</option> <option>forest</option><option>mountain</option><option>hill</option><option>valley</option><option>plateau</option> <option>desert</option><option>canyon</option><option>island</option><option>delta</option><option>marsh</option> <option>grassland</option><option>tundra</option><option>snow</option><option>urban</option><option>unknown</option> </select> <input class=\"classColor\" type=\"color\" /> <button class=\"removeClass\" type=\"button\">×</button> </div> </template> <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>"
}